author ai
file crates/ui/src/tree.rs
symbol end
lines 0 28
hash 01d39c3aec580a99
note Layout, once, for the whole frame, with the renderer as the Measure. Each axis gets a fit pass bottom-up and a grow pass top-down; after the horizontal axis, with widths final and heights not, wrapped text learns how many lines it takes; then one pass places every element, and every id's Placement is stored for next frame's input. Floating elements are left out of every flow calculation and sized against the window instead.

