file crates/ui/src/tree.rs
symbol scroll_by_wheel
lines 0 50
hash 39eedf45a5ce7cf3
note Scrolls an offset by the wheel when the element is the hit or the mouse is inside its visible rectangle, clamps it to the content extent the element showed last frame, and returns it for the caller to build the element with. The scrollbar is live here too: pressing the thumb starts a drag that follows the mouse from where it grabbed, and clicking the track jumps so the clicked point is centred. The offset is the caller's state, not the tree's.

