file crates/ui/src/tree.rs
symbol fit_leaf
lines 0 14
hash a69925c21d4c22da
note A childless element's fitting size: nothing but padding unless it is text. A text line is its columns (characters, icons counting two) times the cell width - one monospace font is the whole reason a width is countable rather than measured per glyph - and a row high; a wrapped text contributes nothing on the width axis and a clipped one only its padding, because the width of either is whatever it is given; a wrapped text is its line count times the row height on the other axis, a clipped one a row.

